Ques 13. Build a Blog Layout Page using HTML5 semantic structure:
● <header> → Blog name
● <nav> → Menu (Home, Blogs, About)
● <main> →
○ <article> 1: “My First Blog”

○ <article> 2: “Things I Learned This Week”
● Each article should have its own heading, paragraph, <time> tag, and <blockquote>
inside.
● <footer> → “Written by [Your Name]”.



Ans 13. 
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Keshav's Blog</title>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>Keshav's Learning Blog</h1>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#">Home</a> |
    <a href="#">Blogs</a> |
    <a href="#">About</a>
</nav>

<main>

    <article>

        <h2>My First Blog</h2>

        <time datetime="2026-08-27">
            27 August 2026
        </time>

        <p>
            Today I started writing my first blog. I am learning
            HTML and understanding how websites are created using
            different HTML elements.
        </p>

        <blockquote>
            "Every expert was once a beginner."
        </blockquote>

    </article>

    <article>

        <h2>Things I Learned This Week</h2>

        <time datetime="2026-08-27">
            27 August 2026
        </time>

        <p>
            This week I learned about HTML tables, forms, lists,
            semantic tags and how different HTML elements are used
            to structure a webpage.
        </p>

        <blockquote>
            "Learning something new every day makes us better."
        </blockquote>

    </article>

</main>

<footer>
    <p>Written by Keshav</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>